#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<wmemcpy> function is the wide-character equivalent of the B<memcpy> "
#| "function. It copies I<n> wide characters from the array starting at "
#| "I<src> to the array starting at I<dest>."
msgid ""
"The B<wmemcpy>()  function is the wide-character equivalent of the "
"B<memcpy>(3)  function.  It copies I<n> wide characters from the array "
"starting at I<src> to the array starting at I<dest>."
msgstr ""
"A função B<wmemcpy> é a equivalente para caracteres largos da função "
"B<memcpy>. Copia I<n> caracteres largos do 'array' iniciando em I<src> para "
"o 'array' iniciando em I<dest>."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The arrays may not overlap; use B<wmemmove>(3) to copy between "
#| "overlapping arrays."
msgid ""
"The arrays may not overlap; use B<wmemmove>(3)  to copy between overlapping "
"arrays."
msgstr ""
"Os 'arrays' não podem se sobrepor; use B<wmemmove>(3) para copiar entre "
"vetores com sobreposição."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The programmer must ensure that there is room for at least I<n> wide "
"characters at I<dest>."
msgstr ""
"O programador deve assegurar que há espaço para pelo menos I<n> caracteres "
"largos em I<dest>."

